    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "sometimes i just sit in my car in the driveway for an hour before going inside because the silence in the house feels so heavy. i wonder if there's any way to actually make the fog lift, or if this is just what it's like now. it feels like i'm just stuck in a loop of nothingness. i just want it to be over. the nothingness, i mean. i just want to finally feel some kind of peace from it all.",
